ISO-10303-21;
/* Pmi058: PMI annotation is scoped to one CONFIGURATION_ITEM via CONFIGURATION_DESIGN, but the configuration-association is dropped on export so annotations become universally visible across all configurations; two DRAUGHTING_MODELs (one per saved view) are present but the CONFIGURATION_DESIGN linking the annotation plane to only one configuration is missing the design reference; receivers must preserve configuration scope and warn when unsupported; silently universalizing visibility is forbidden; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
